<title>UK: Cie Bancaire sets 2.0 bln Ffr bond.</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire sets 2.0 bln Ffr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIE BANCAIRE</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    19.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.66    PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    99.36     SPREAD	+28 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.9	 SELL CONC  0.8	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
